  "front_knee_ffc": "The front leg the instant it lands. Red is your hip, knee and ankle; dashed blue is where the shin would sit at the elite average knee angle.",
  "front_knee_release": "The front leg as the ball leaves the hand. Red is your hip, knee and ankle; dashed blue is the shin at the elite average knee angle.",
  "knee_extension": "The front knee at release. After its most bent point the elite knee straightens by about 12 degrees before release; this shows how far yours had come back.",
  "plant_angle": "The front leg as it lands. Red runs hip to ankle; dashed blue is the elite average angle from vertical.",
  "foot_strike": "The front foot as it lands. Red runs ankle to toe; dashed blue is the elite average foot angle.",
  "lean_back_bfc": "The instant the back foot lands. Red runs from the back ankle to the shoulders; dashed blue is the elite average lean.",
  "stride_pct_height": "Both feet at front foot contact. Red is the distance between your ankles; dashed blue is the elite average stride scaled to your body.",
  "release_pct_height": "The release instant. Red is your wrist height above the ground; the blue mark is the elite average release height scaled to your body."
